<p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature%23def%3Abusemann-function\">↗ def:busemann-function</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature%23def%3Aasymptotic-ray\">↗ def:asymptotic-ray</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature%23lem%3Aasymptotic-ray\">↗ lem:asymptotic-ray</a> <p></p>If <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$x=\\mu (0)$\">$x=\\mu (0)$</span> and <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\mu $\">$\\mu $</span> is asymptotic to <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\lambda $\">$\\lambda $</span>, then <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\[ B_\\lambda (y)\\le B_\\lambda (x)-t+d(y,\\mu (t)) \\]\">\\[ B_\\lambda (y)\\le B_\\lambda (x)-t+d(y,\\mu (t)) \\]</span> for every <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$y\\in M$\">$y\\in M$</span> and <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$t\\ge 0$\">$t\\ge 0$</span>.  <section class=\"theorem proof\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proof</div><p>\\sketch </p><p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature%23lem%3Abusemann-lipschitz\">↗ lem:busemann-lipschitz</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature%23lem%3Aasymptotic-ray\">↗ lem:asymptotic-ray</a> Apply the Lipschitz bound between <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$y$\">$y$</span> and <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\mu (t)$\">$\\mu (t)$</span> and then use Lemma <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature%23lem%3Aasymptotic-ray\" data-tex-node=\"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#lem:asymptotic-ray\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a6173796d70746f7469632d726179\">2</a>. </p><span class=\"qed\" aria-label=\"证毕\" style=\"display:block;text-align:right\">□</span></section> <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Lemma</div></section>[Busemann gradient along an asymptotic ray]","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: sketch"]},"previous":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#lem:asymptotic-ray","next":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#lem:busemann-gradient-norm-one","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#def:busemann-function","title":"def:busemann-function","label":"def:busemann-function"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#def:asymptotic-ray","title":"def:asymptotic-ray","label":"def:asymptotic-ray"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#lem:asymptotic-ray","title":"lem:asymptotic-ray","label":"lem:asymptotic-ray"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#lem:busemann-lipschitz","title":"lem:busemann-lipschitz","label":"lem:busemann-lipschitz"}],"backlinks":[],"copy_context":{"version":1,"level":0,"node":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#cor:asymptotic-ray-busemann-bound","title":"cor:asymptotic-ray-busemann-bound","tex":"\\begin{corollary}[Busemann upper bound from an asymptotic ray]\n\\label{cor:asymptotic-ray-busemann-bound}\n\n\\uses{def:busemann-function, def:asymptotic-ray, lem:asymptotic-ray}\n\n\n\n\nIf $x=\\mu(0)$ and $\\mu$ is asymptotic to $\\lambda$, then\n$$B_\\lambda(y)\\le B_\\lambda(x)-t+d(y,\\mu(t))$$\nfor every $y\\in M$ and $t\\ge0$.\n\\end{corollary}\n\\begin{proof}\n\\sketch\n\n\\uses{lem:busemann-lipschitz,lem:asymptotic-ray}\nApply the Lipschitz bound between $y$ and $\\mu(t)$ and then use\nLemma~\\ref{lem:asymptotic-ray}.\n\\end{proof}\n\n\\begin{lemma}[Busemann gradient along an asymptotic ray]","source":"tex/references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature.tex","description":"","dependencies":[{"node":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#def:busemann-function","title":"def:busemann-function","description":""},{"node":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#def:asymptotic-ray","title":"def:asymptotic-ray","description":""},{"node":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#lem:asymptotic-ray","title":"lem:asymptotic-ray","description":""},{"node":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#lem:busemann-lipschitz","title":"lem:busemann-lipschitz","description":""}],"dependencies_omitted":0,"unresolved_dependencies":[],"unresolved_omitted":0}}